        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Nickow, Oreopoulos and Quan (2020) synthesize experimental evidence on one-to-one and small-group tutoring across PreK–12 settings. The NBER working paper reports a pooled learning effect of 0.37 standard deviations and compares tutor type, grade, subject and delivery setting.",
