        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Nickow, Oreopoulos and Quan (2020) report an overall pooled effect size of 0.37 standard deviations across experimental PreK–12 tutoring studies. Effects vary by tutor type, grade, subject and whether tutoring occurs during school; the pooled estimate does not describe every implementation.",
